---
import Settings from '../../layouts/Settings.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import {FITNESS_PROVIDERS as services} from '../../lib/fitness-providers.mjs';
---
<Settings title="Activities & maps settings" section="connections"><section class="settings-section"><h2>Activities & maps</h2><p>View an exported GPX, TCX or FIT route, or connect Strava for read-only activity previews. Choose what to open; nothing is published automatically.</p><a class="btn" href="/places"><Icon name="mountain" size={16}/>Open map & route viewer</a></section><section class="settings-section"><h2>Your activity connections</h2><p>Strava is ready for administrator configuration. The other services are being prepared. GPX, TCX and FIT route viewing works now. Strava can be configured below; the other direct connections are not connected yet.</p><div class="service-list">{services.map(service=><article><div class="service-top"><h3>{service.name}</h3><span id={service.id==='strava'?'strava-state-badge':undefined}>{service.status}</span></div><p>{service.summary}</p>{service.id==='strava'&&<div id="strava-connection"><p id="strava-status" role="status">Checking Strava connection…</p><div class="strava-actions"><button type="button" class="btn" id="strava-connect" hidden>Connect Strava</button><button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="strava-load" hidden>Choose an activity</button><button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="strava-disconnect" hidden>Disconnect</button></div><p id="strava-import-note" role="status"></p><div id="strava-activities"></div><button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="strava-more" hidden>More activities</button><details id="strava-setup-help" hidden><summary>Administrator setup</summary><p>Register the Explore application at <a href="https://www.strava.com/settings/api" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Strava API settings</a>. Use <code>www.claudiagilbert.com</code> as the callback domain.</p><p>In Netlify Functions / Production, configure <code>STRAVA_CLIENT_ID</code>, <code>STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET</code>, <code>STRAVA_REDIRECT_URI</code> as <code>https://www.claudiagilbert.com/api/fitness/strava/callback</code>, and <code>STRAVA_ENABLED=true</code>. Keep the existing encryption key unchanged. Redeploy after setting variables. Confirm Strava’s current API terms and athlete capacity before enabling accounts.</p></details></div>}<details><summary>Connection availability</summary><p>{service.availability}</p><a href={service.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Provider information <Icon name="arrow" size={14}/></a></details></article>)}</div></section><section class="settings-section"><h2>Keep your routes private</h2><p>File previews stay in your current browser view; this map does not upload or publish them. Exact track points may reveal a home address or a regular routine. Clear the track when finished, especially on a shared device.</p><p>Strava previews are fetched for this view, without saving an activity history in Explore. Connection tokens are encrypted on the server. Connecting a service does not publish your activities.</p><p>Map providers receive requests for the area you view. Disconnect Strava to remove its saved authorization; provider revocation is attempted too.</p></section><p>Looking for where apps save documents and photographs? <a href="/studio/storage">Files & storage →</a></p></Settings>
<script>import '../../scripts/fitness-connections';</script>
<style>.service-list article{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0}.service-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.service-top h3{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.service-list summary{font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;min-height:30px;display:flex;align-items:center}.service-list details p{font-size:12px}.service-list details[open]{padding-bottom:8px}.service-top h3{margin:0}.service-top span{font-size:10px;opacity:.7;text-align:right;max-width:150px;flex-shrink:0}.service-list a{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}.service-list p{margin:8px 0 10px}@media(max-width:550px){.service-top{align-items:flex-start}.service-top h3{font-size:17px}.service-top span{max-width:100px}.service-list summary,.service-list a{min-height:44px}}@media(forced-colors:active){.service-top span{opacity:1}}.strava-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.strava-actions button,#strava-more{font-size:12px}.service-list #strava-status,.service-list #strava-import-note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.service-list :global(#strava-activities article){padding:12px 0}.service-list :global(#strava-activities strong){font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.service-list :global(#strava-activities p){font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}#strava-setup-help code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}#strava-setup-help p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}.service-list :global(.activity-actions){display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 16px}.service-list :global(.activity-actions a){min-height:44px}.service-list :global(#strava-activities p){overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(pointer:coarse){.strava-actions button,#strava-more,.service-list summary{min-height:44px}}</style>
